## ADDED — flows：s02-lite-conversion（1 个 flow）

> 追加到 `flows` 数组末尾。case_id 复用 test-cases.md 的 ST-S02-16（UT-S02-26/27 为响应枚举与归属断言，由同 flow 的 assert 覆盖）。

```json
[
  {
    "case_id": "ST-S02-16",
    "type": "normal",
    "description": "near_term_todo 选择「先记一下」：wish 转轻事件（s02-lite-conversion）",
    "covers_steps": "S02 EX-18.2 增补",
    "steps": [
      {
        "step": "前置：LLM mock 置 near_term_todo 模式",
        "method": "PUT",
        "url": "{{mock_base}}/_control",
        "body": {
          "mode": "near_term_todo"
        },
        "expected_status": 204
      },
      {
        "step": "Step 12→21: 种下（near_term_todo 判定）",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "body": {
          "source": "text",
          "text": "明天下午 3 点开会"
        },
        "expected_status": 201,
        "extract": {
          "wish_id": "body.wish.id"
        },
        "assert": [
          "'save_as_lite' in body.actions"
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "EX-18.2 增补: 转换为轻事件",
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}/convert-to-lite",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "expected_status": 201,
        "extract": {
          "lite_id": "body.id"
        },
        "assert": [
          "body.text == '明天下午 3 点开会'",
          "body.status == 'open'"
        ]
      },
      {
        "step": "原 wish_id 消失",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/wishes/{{wish_id}}",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "expected_status": 404
      },
      {
        "step": "轻事件列表含转换条目",
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/lite-events",
        "headers": {
          "Authorization": "Bearer {{access_token}}"
        },
        "expected_status": 200,
        "assert": [
          "any(i['id'] == '{{lite_id}}' for i in body.items)"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
]
```
